unpleasant way why one should  never look at a rotating airplane  propeller  up close the action-packed exit of the  two is then topped off by a lovely  explosion christian bale and liam neeson  gave us an equally adrenaline-filled  fight scene in the 2005 film  batman begins the conflict between bruce  wayne and rozelle gould takes place on a  moving train is perfectly staged by  director christopher nolan  while gordon is awkwardly attempting to  give batman an advantage with his  batmobile he blows up a bridge pillar  which means certain  death for all occupants in case it  crashes  since batman's moral code forbids  killing his opponent he decides to save  himself just before the wagon falls  leaving all ghoul behind as it is not  against his principles not to save  someone the sequence ends with a  spectacular crash of the train and a  triumphant batman gliding through gotham  city thereafter freddy vs jason from  2003 is the only one in this list to  belong to the horror genre  but it is by no means less action-packed  than other movies  the battle between the two horror icons  freddy krueger and jason voris is  initially slow to get started  this changes abruptly when actress  laurie manages to lure the two evil  creatures to chris lake by means of a  trick  this is where the trouble really begins  the physically superior jason makes  freddy look like a complete fool at the  beginning of the fight and gives him a  hard time in the burning hut  a ruthless fight develops between the  two icons though  ultimately it's not really clear which  one of the two will emerge victorious  in the end both seem to have somehow won  and lost at the same time  nevertheless this fight is really  something to behold  with superpowers it's of course much  easier to fight through huge hordes of  enemies  that's certainly what thor actor chris  hemsworth must have thought in thor  ragnarok as his character  effortlessly finds his way forward bit  by bit on a footbridge  after activating his superpowers  meanwhile led zeppelin's immigrant song  plays and you don't even know which way  to look anymore  in the end loki was most certainly  grateful for the friendly support  which fight do you think is missing and  should we take a closer look at battles  from movies like lord of the rings and  avengers end game  please let us know in the comments  [Music]  you

